    PageSpeed Insights (report of 2026-11-15) flags the word cloud for missing
    explicit dimensions (layout shift risk) and for being oversized on small
    viewports (1600x400 served for a ~375x94 mobile display). The explicit
    width/height attributes reserve the 4:1 aspect-ratio box before the image
    loads. Serving smaller variants requires new Git LFS binaries; generate a
    450w candidate from the original source with:
    cwebp -resize 450 0 -q 80 nuage-de-mots.png -o nuage-de-mots-450x113.webp
    -->
